{"id":29,"titleZh":"告别民族主义","titleEn":"A Farewell to Nationalism","date":"1964-11-30","dateZh":"1964 年 11 月 30 日","concepts":"民族主义百年、战后国际共通语、双乐队多节奏","thesis":"19 世纪音乐贴满浓郁的俄国或西班牙地方味道，但进入二战后交通与传播的现代社会，各地前沿作曲家写出的声音逐渐趋向统一。","plain":"令人意外的是，1800 年之前的巴赫与维瓦尔第本就没有明显国籍腔调；真正浓烈的地方“民族味”集中在 1800 到 1900 年间。二战之后，随着世界联系加速，不同大洲的现代派不约而同走向无国界语言，民族风味成为一个时代的温柔背影。","scenes":["盲听猜国籍对照实验：先播俄国与西班牙名曲让孩子立刻猜出国家；随后连播韦伯恩（奥地利）、黛敏郎（日本）、巴比特（美国）与诺诺（意大利）的现代音乐，地理相距万里却几乎辨不出国别，再回放巴赫与维瓦尔第印证早年同样超国界。","讲美国作曲家艾夫斯《独立日》时，现场把百人爱乐劈成两半，请助理指挥利普金站起来同步以完全不同的速度与拍子对打指挥，模拟街头两支迎面错过的游行铜管乐队。"],"category":"文化与跨界","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1Qa4y1i79K","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qa4y1i79K","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 告别民族主义","duration":"53:30","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/farewell-to-nationalism","repertoire":[{"composer":"Reinhold Glière","piece":"Russian Sailors' Dance from The Red Poppy","titleZh":"俄罗斯水手舞","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Reinhold%20Gli%C3%A8re%20Russian%20Sailors%27%20Dance%20from%20The%20Red%20Poppy+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Reinhold%20Gli%C3%A8re%20Russian%20Sailors%27%20Dance%20from%20The%20Red%20Poppy"},{"composer":"Anton Webern","piece":"Five Pieces for Orchestra, Op. 10, No. 1","titleZh":"管弦乐五首","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview126/v4/f8/74/9d/f8749d07-fcb7-7822-a63b-8ef48f654f5f/mzaf_4468910087149820882.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/five-pieces-for-orchestra-op-10-no-1-sehr-ruhig-und-zart/1452291881?i=1452292330&uo=4","recordingArtist":"The Cleveland Orchestra & Christoph von Dohnányi","recordingTrack":"Five Pieces for Orchestra, Op. 10: No. 1, Sehr ruhig und zart","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Anton%20Webern%20Five%20Pieces%20for%2